meta {
  name: Create Address
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "recipient_name": "Example",
    "street": "string",
    "city": "string",
    "postal_code": "EXAMPLE10",
    "country": "US"
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Customer (bearer)

**Request body** `AddressCreate`:
  - `label`: string|null
  - `recipient_name`: string (required)
  - `street`: string (required)
  - `city`: string (required)
  - `postal_code`: string (required)
  - `country`: string (required)
  - `state`: string|null
  - `phone`: string|null
  - `is_default_shipping`: boolean
  - `is_default_billing`: boolean

**Responses:** 201, 422
}
